<details class="tm-cm-help"><summary><$transclude tiddler="$:/language/tidme/manager.autopostpone.help.title">Auto-Postpone Documentation</$transclude></summary>

<$transclude tiddler="$:/language/tidme/manager.autopostpone.help.desc">Auto-postpone automatically defers lower-priority overdue cards daily (at startup and every hour) while preserving high-priority cards. Configure via <code>$:/config/Tidme/AutoPostpone</code>: <code>{"enable": true, "maxPriority": 60, "postponeDays": 7, "keepTop": 10}</code>.</$transclude>

</details>

<$transclude tiddler="$:/language/tidme/manager.subset.desc">Subset Review: The "Review Book" button on document pages creates a temporary subset deck for that book's cards, which is automatically cleaned up after review.</$transclude>
